    "Nintendo 会话已过期或无效，请重新登录":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your Nintendo session has expired or is invalid. Sign in again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 会话已过期或无效，请重新登录"}}}},
    "Nintendo 服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo services are temporarily unavailable. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试"}}}},
    "Nintendo 登录回调验证失败，请重新登录":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo sign-in callback validation failed. Sign in again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 登录回调验证失败，请重新登录"}}}},
    "Nintendo 登录完成，但没有返回授权码":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo sign-in finished without returning an authorization code."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 登录完成，但没有返回授权码"}}}},
    "Nintendo 登录已在进行中，请先完成或取消当前登录":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo sign-in is already in progress. Complete or cancel it first."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 登录已在进行中，请先完成或取消当前登录"}}}},
    "Nintendo 登录未能完成，请重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo sign-in could not be completed. Try again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 登录未能完成，请重试"}}}},
    "Nintendo 请求失败，请稍后重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The Nintendo request failed. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 请求失败，请稍后重试"}}}},
    "Nintendo 请求过于频繁，请稍后重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Too many Nintendo requests. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 请求过于频繁，请稍后重试"}}}},
    "Nintendo 返回的数据格式无法读取":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The data returned by Nintendo could not be read."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo 返回的数据格式无法读取"}}}},
    "Nintendo、PlayStation 与 Steam，一张卡片看完你的游戏生活。":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo, PlayStation and Steam. Your gaming life in one card."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nintendo、PlayStation 与 Steam，一张卡片看完你的游戏生活。"}}}},
    "PSN 游戏列表分页不完整或已变化，请重新同步":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The PSN game library pages are incomplete or have changed. Sync again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PSN 游戏列表分页不完整或已变化，请重新同步"}}}},
    "PSN 请求失败，请稍后重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The PSN request failed. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PSN 请求失败，请稍后重试"}}}},
    "PSN 请求过于频繁，请稍后重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Too many PSN requests. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PSN 请求过于频繁，请稍后重试"}}}},
