    "PlayStation 服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation services are temporarily unavailable. Try again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation 服务暂时不可用，请稍后重试"}}}},
    "PlayStation 未授予授权，请重新登录并允许访问":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation authorization was not granted. Sign in again and allow access."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation 未授予授权，请重新登录并允许访问"}}}},
    "PlayStation 登录回调验证失败，请重新登录":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation sign-in callback validation failed. Sign in again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation 登录回调验证失败，请重新登录"}}}},
