    "PlayStation 登录已在进行中，请先完成或取消当前登录":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation sign-in is already in progress. Complete or cancel it first."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation 登录已在进行中，请先完成或取消当前登录"}}}},
    "PlayStation 登录未能完成，请重试":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation sign-in could not be completed. Try again."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PlayStation 登录未能完成，请重试"}}}},
    "Steam 刷新失败：%@。上方保留上次同步结果。":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam refresh failed: %@. The last synced results are shown above."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam 刷新失败：%@。上方保留上次同步结果。"}}}},
    "Steam 客户端内没有密钥入口。请在浏览器登录 Steam 官方密钥页面，查看或申请密钥，再复制到下方。":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"API keys are not available in the Steam client. Sign in to Steam’s official API key page in your browser, view or register a key, then paste it below."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam 客户端内没有密钥入口。请在浏览器登录 Steam 官方密钥页面，查看或申请密钥，再复制到下方。"}}}},
    "Steam 尚未完成同步":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam hasn’t finished syncing"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam 尚未完成同步"}}}},
    "Steam 没有返回游戏。请检查个人资料的“游戏详情”隐私设置；改为公开会让其他人也能查看相关游戏信息":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam returned no games. Check the “Game details” privacy setting on your profile. Making it public also lets other people see your game information."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steam 没有返回游戏。请检查个人资料的“游戏详情”隐私设置；改为公开会让其他人也能查看相关游戏信息"}}}},
