    "这是当前测试版的接入方式。Web API Key 属于开发者凭据，正式版还需改进授权流程。请勿把密钥发给他人。":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This is the current beta connection method. A Web API key is a developer credential; the authorization flow still needs improvement for release. Never share your key."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这是当前测试版的接入方式。Web API Key 属于开发者凭据，正式版还需改进授权流程。请勿把密钥发给他人。"}}}},
